<title>UK: Galeries Lafayette sets 800 mln Ffr bond.</title>
<headline>Galeries Lafayette sets 800 mln Ffr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banque Nationale de Paris and Credit Commerical de France.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GALERIES LAFAYETTE</p>
<p> AMT    800 MLN FFR   COUPON     6.20 PCT  MATURITY    09.DEC.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.672   PAY DATE    09.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.70	REOFFER    100.322   SPREAD	+77 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    PARIS</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) FIVE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND OCT 2003 AND FEB 2004 OATS -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
